type: software
title: "Observatory Night Log pipeline built with Pixeltable"
abstract: "Migrate a messy legacy observatory night log CSV into Pixeltable without losing a row: parse coordinates and photometry as computed columns, keep each failed parse as a per-column error, fix the source values and recompute only the failed cells."
